## Pipeline overview

```
Week 1-2 row → Competitor pass → Brief → Draft (v5) → Type 2 carousel WebPs → WP **new** publish → Yoast → FAQs + schema → Checklist v2 → Higgsfield Type 3 (last) → Upload images → Patch post → Live audit → Update xlsx
```

