+    "Bangle size chart in mm, cm and inches": "<!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Indian bangle size</th><th>Inner diameter, mm</th><th>Inner diameter, cm</th><th>Inner diameter, inches</th><th>Inner circumference, mm</th><th>Inner circumference, cm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2-2</td><td>54.0</td><td>5.40</td><td>2.125</td><td>169.4</td><td>16.94</td></tr><tr><td>2-4</td><td>57.2</td><td>5.72</td><td>2.250</td><td>179.6</td><td>17.96</td></tr><tr><td>2-6</td><td>60.3</td><td>6.03</td><td>2.375</td><td>189.5</td><td>18.95</td></tr><tr><td>2-8</td><td>63.5</td><td>6.35</td><td>2.500</td><td>199.4</td><td>19.94</td></tr><tr><td>2-10</td><td>66.7</td><td>6.67</td><td>2.625</td><td>209.3</td><td>20.93</td></tr><tr><td>2-12</td><td>69.9</td><td>6.99</td><td>2.750</td><td>219.5</td><td>21.95</td></tr><tr><td>2-14</td><td>73.0</td><td>7.30</td><td>2.875</td><td>229.4</td><td>22.94</td></tr><tr><td>3-0</td><td>76.2</td><td>7.62</td><td>3.000</td><td>239.3</td><td>23.93</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Indian bangle size conversion chart using inner measurements. Product-specific guidance takes priority for openable and adjustable designs.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:table -->"
