+        "A store visit is useful when swelling, arthritis, injury, pregnancy, or reduced hand mobility makes sliding a closed bangle difficult.",
+        "Bring the bangle that fits best and explain whether you prefer a close daily fit or more movement for occasional wear.",
+        "Try the exact construction whenever possible because a round closed bangle and a hinged oval bangle can feel different at similar measurements.",
+        "Test the clasp, wrist movement, hand clearance, and removal process while help is available.",
+        "Ask which measurement is used for the specific product and whether the size can be altered without affecting the design or stone setting.",
+        "For a surprise gift, bring a well-fitting bangle or arrange an exchange-friendly selection instead of estimating from age or appearance.",
+        "If a bangle becomes stuck, causes numbness, severe swelling, colour change, or pain, stop forcing it and seek appropriate professional help."
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "key": "sources",
+      "h2": "Fact sources for this bangle size guide",
+      "lines": [
+        "The BlueStone Bangle Measuring Guide provides the hand-circumference and existing-bangle methods used in this article.",
+        "The BlueStone chart lists Indian sizes with corresponding inner diameter and inner circumference values in millimetres.",
+        "The Gem and Jewellery Skill Council of India retail training handbook independently lists the standard diameter progression.",
+        "The circumference values are rounded conversions of the listed inner diameters and can differ by about one tenth of a millimetre between charts.",
+        "The chart is a selection guide rather than a universal guarantee because shape, width, hinge construction, and manufacturing tolerance affect fit.",
+        "Product-specific instructions take priority when they define a different measurement method for an openable or adjustable design.",
+        "The existing BlueStone at-home measurement article is linked as a shorter companion for readers who need only the basic method.",
+        "No competitor URL was supplied in the Week 6 row and no competitor page was used to build the article structure.",
